00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:18.230
It looks like Rito-san doesn't hate them.

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:19.260
I don't care about that.

00:17:19.740 --> 00:17:22.450
I don't really have any interest in that guy, anyway.

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:23.980
Really?

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:29.110
You have your own charm that nobody else does, Nana.

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:36.840
That womaniser...

