00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:53.700
<b>~Budding Feelings?~」</b>

00:17:57.270 --> 00:17:59.120
Oh, what are you doing, Celine?

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:00.630
Are you a florist?

00:18:02.000 --> 00:18:02.850
Eh?

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:05.220
I've never seen these flowers before.

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:13.300
Such a nice scent.

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:15.360
Huh?

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:25.700
Celine-san!

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:28.380
You shouldn't do that!

00:18:28.380 --> 00:18:31.920
Don't bring out my flowers by yourself.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:33.250
Oh!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:36.010
Isn't that a jikido flower?

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:40.840
This is a dangerous flower that changes the personality of any person who smells it.

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:45.350
It probably won't affect you because you came from a plant,

00:18:45.350 --> 00:18:47.760
but if anybody else were to smell it, it could cause problems.

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:50.930
Eh?!

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:52.300
Rito-san did?

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:55.610
He smelled it and then went somewhere?

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:58.900
Lala!

00:18:58.900 --> 00:18:59.550
Yes?

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:02.650
Lend me one of your inventions!

00:19:02.650 --> 00:19:04.090
What's wrong, Rito?

00:19:04.090 --> 00:19:05.730
Just hurry up!

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:09.330
First is this!

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.920
All right, I'll check to see it works.

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:18.910
Are you looking at me?

00:19:18.910 --> 00:19:21.130
I'm checking to make sure it works!

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:30.780
Hey, come on.

00:19:30.780 --> 00:19:32.430
Show me some poses!

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:34.810
How is this?

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.360
How about this?

00:19:44.220 --> 00:19:44.890
That's great!

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:45.410
Do some more!

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.990
Then how about this?

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:50.990
That's great, just like that!

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:52.250
Do more poses!

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:56.520
Even though Peke made those clothes,

00:19:56.520 --> 00:19:58.020
I can see right through them!

00:20:00.040 --> 00:20:02.810
This is kind of embarrassing...

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.430
That's it!

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:14.120
I want to see more!

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:15.140
Naked bodies!

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:16.480
Boobs! {You and I both.}{Indeed.}

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:18.480
All right!

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.190
I'll go to school!

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:22.750
Huh, Rito?

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:25.910
You're going to school?

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:27.920
Are you on duty today or something?

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:38.920
Why don't we take a bath together tonight?

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:39.800
Huh?!

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:50.950
Oh, Rito-kun!

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:02.210
Huh?

00:21:02.210 --> 00:21:03.990
You sure are in high spirits.

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:08.320
This is... paradise!

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:11.370
This is how this invention is supposed to be used!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:13.290
What have I been doing up until now?! {That's what I want to ask}

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:16.740
Yuuki-kun?

00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:17.790
Don't run in the hallwa-

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:18.840
Oh!

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:19.840
Ah!

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:49.700
Why, you...!

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.860
Why are you always doing things like that?!

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:55.530
Feel some shame, would you?!

00:22:06.270 --> 00:22:09.500
I can't be satisfied with just looking anymore!

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:12.600
I'll climb even higher!

00:22:13.120 --> 00:22:13.930
Sairenji!

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:15.850
Next, I'll find Sairenji...

00:22:16.260 --> 00:22:21.690
...tear her clothes to pieces with this crab and tie her up with Kuru-Kuru-Rope-kun!

00:22:33.570 --> 00:22:35.450
No~

00:22:35.890 --> 00:22:37.560
You can't do that, Rito-san!

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:38.120
Oh?

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:39.600
Momo?

00:22:39.600 --> 00:22:43.380
You can see through clothes with those glasses, right?

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:51.280
I can't believe it would turn him into 
someone who would abuse inventions like that.

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:53.150
If I let him run wild any more than this,

00:22:53.150 --> 00:22:55.350
we won't be able to go back.

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:56.810
Ah!

00:22:58.780 --> 00:23:01.810
Momo, my eyes have opened!

00:23:02.550 --> 00:23:04.290
Your harem plan?

00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:06.220
It's perfect.

00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:10.320
If I have Lala's inventions and your plants,

00:23:10.320 --> 00:23:13.060
I can do anything I want!

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:19.900
I'll become the king of the harem!

00:23:22.410 --> 00:23:24.190
That's impossible.

00:23:24.190 --> 00:23:26.990
The way you are now, you won't be able to make a harem.

00:23:28.440 --> 00:23:32.560
Return to yourself with the scent of this kenja flower.

00:23:32.560 --> 00:23:35.390
To your normal, sincere self.

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:43.400
It's because of your gentleness and respect for women that you will...

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:51.820
He fainted.

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:55.370
He must have seen a lot of stimulating
things while he was running wild like that.

00:23:57.090 --> 00:24:00.960
There's no need to rush becoming carnivorous, Rito-san.

00:24:01.560 --> 00:24:06.210
I'll guide you down that path, little by little.

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:14.320
I might have overdone it a little bit before, but...

00:24:14.320 --> 00:24:17.970
If you hadn't done something so shameless in the first place...

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:19.290
Next time, be more carefu-

00:24:19.290 --> 00:24:20.020
I'm not looking!

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:22.000
I'm not looking at anything!

00:24:22.000 --> 00:24:22.880
Huh?
